  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "符文可为武器和能力附加多重射击、轨道刀刃与元素爆发，并能自由混搭扩展武库",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Modify your weapons and abilities using Runes that grant devastating effects like multishot, orbital blades, elemental bursts, and more. Mix and match Runes to expand your arsenal and wreak havoc across the battlefield.",
