      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "时间、幸运、专注、力量和平衡五条路线可同路叠加，达到门槛后解锁强协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from five distinct Paths — Time, Luck, Focus, Power, and Balance — and stack upgrades within the same path to unlock powerful synergies and become an unstoppable force of nature.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147530/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "水火气电按环境发生连锁反应，敌人还会随当前状态动态获得抗性与弱点",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Elements react with one another in powerful and unexpected ways — fire ignites, water douses, electricity surges through moisture, and more. These interactions can drastically alter the flow of battle. Meanwhile, enemies adapt to their current state, gaining new resistances and vulnerabilities on the fly.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147530/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
